WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The invisible visitor. A task can narrow what you notice.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Count the light passes. Your attention has a job.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.000
An unexpected figure crosses the scene.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Some observers miss it. That is inattentional blindness.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Even experts can miss an unexpected event when attention is directed elsewhere.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:40.000
A report is not a camera. Ask what the task allowed someone to see.
